OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's grooming gangs inquiry
OL,4,Ato begin work next week - minister
OL,5,Atells Holyrood
OL,6,
OL,7,FFollowing FMQs, Scottish minister
OL,8,FMC iri McAllan made a statement on the
OL,9,Fgrooming gangs inquiry, telling MSPs
OL,10,Fthat work will get under way next week
OL,12,FAhead of that address, First Minister
OL,13,FJohn Swinney answered questions of
OL,14,Fopposition party leaders
OL,16,FScottish Labour leader Michael Marra
OL,17,Fsaid John Swinney's government was not
OL,18,Fsupporting jobs. The First Minister
OL,19,Freplied that he had pressed UK PM Andy
OL,20,FBurnham to change current laws as they
OL,21,Fdid not give "us enough scope to
OL,22,Finvest"
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
