OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's grooming gangs inquiry
OL,4,Ato begin work next week - minister
OL,5,Atells Holyrood
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's Reform leader Malcolm Offord
OL,8,Fraised North Sea oil investment and
OL,9,Faccused Swinney of "giving up on
OL,10,FAberdeen and Scotland". Scottish
OL,11,FConservative leader Russell Findlay
OL,12,Falso focused on the future of the oil
OL,13,Findustry.
OL,15,FThe FM says he would like to see a
OL,16,Fgreater pace in renewables in the north
OL,17,Fof the country, but that was being
OL,18,Fhampered by the UK government's poor
OL,19,Fapproach to grid connections
